		{"id":"a1a1a1a1a1a1a1a1","type":"text","text":"# Farming Web App Game.base\n\nดูว่า 2 views ถูกสร้างยังไง — filter → order/group → ผลลัพธ์","x":-100,"y":-200,"width":700,"height":100},
		{"id":"b2b2b2b2b2b2b2b2","type":"file","file":"base-farming-web-app-game.example.base","x":-100,"y":-60,"width":700,"height":340},
		{"id":"e1e1e1e1e1e1e1e1","type":"text","text":"## Filter\n\n```yaml\nfilters:\n  or:\n    - 'type == \"Keyword\"'\n    - 'type == \"Microservice\"'\n```\n\nเอา index note ที่เป็น concept/service","x":70,"y":560,"width":560,"height":240},
		{"id":"d1d1d1d1d1d1d1d1","type":"text","text":"## Filter\n\n```yaml\nfilters:\n  and:\n    - 'file.inFolder(\"Notes/farming-web-app-example\")'\n```\n\nเอาเฉพาะไฟล์ในโฟลเดอร์ example notes","x":-710,"y":510,"width":560,"height":220},
		{"id":"d2d2d2d2d2d2d2d2","type":"text","text":"## Order + Group\n\n```yaml\norder:\n  - file.name\n  - type\n  - date\ngroupBy:\n  property: type\n```\n\nโชว์ column ชื่อไฟล์ / type / date จัดกลุ่มตาม type","x":-710,"y":775,"width":560,"height":305},
		{"id":"d3d3d3d3d3d3d3d3","type":"text","text":"## ผลลัพธ์\n\n3 notes ที่ผ่าน filter (note-game-concept, note-tech-stack, research-game-engine) + 1 ไฟล์ WIP ที่ยังไม่มี frontmatter","x":-710,"y":1120,"width":560,"height":140},
		{"id":"e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2","type":"text","text":"## Order\n\n```yaml\norder:\n  - file.name\n  - type\n```\n\nแสดงเป็น card สั้นๆ เหมาะกับเนื้อหาสั้น ไม่ต้อง group","x":70,"y":840,"width":560,"height":220},
		{"id":"e3e3e3e3e3e3e3e3","type":"text","text":"## ผลลัพธ์\n\ncrop-cycle (Keyword), farm-api (Microservice)","x":70,"y":1120,"width":560,"height":140}
	],
